      "start_seconds": 0.87,
      "end_seconds": 6.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Doctor? Hello, um, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.36,
      "end_seconds": 12.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.59,
      "end_seconds": 20.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "Yeah, it's electric shock pains in my cheek. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.49,
      "end_seconds": 25.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.47,
      "end_seconds": 35.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "Okay, so I'd say ten days. Actually, no, closer to two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.9,
      "end_seconds": 38.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.55,
      "end_seconds": 43.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Oh, about a eight out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.79,
      "end_seconds": 46.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "ah any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.34,
      "end_seconds": 64.26,
      "duration_seconds": 16.92,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get being afraid to eat as well. Erm, I've also had pain lasting seconds, for about a week. About pain lasting seconds, severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.33,
      "end_seconds": 68.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "has there been any hearing loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.5,
      "end_seconds": 72.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "no no hearing loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.87,
      "end_seconds": 78.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.04,
      "end_seconds": 83.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "no problems with breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.48,
      "end_seconds": 96.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.87,
      "end_seconds": 100.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I have migraines, for two years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.99,
      "end_seconds": 107.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "and besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.06,
      "end_seconds": 116.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "I've had heart disease, yes. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.63,
      "end_seconds": 136.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.1,
      "end_seconds": 140.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Just a triple bypass, eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.63,
      "end_seconds": 146.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Right, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.42,
      "end_seconds": 161.05,
      "duration_seconds": 12.63,
      "text": "I'm on propranolol, 40 milligrams, twice a day. It's metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my heart. Ah, I'm on paracetamol, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.64,
      "end_seconds": 163.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.85,
      "end_seconds": 165.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "1 gram."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.74,
      "end_seconds": 170.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.8,
      "end_seconds": 177.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.79,
      "end_seconds": 181.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.85,
      "end_seconds": 185.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.96,
      "end_seconds": 189.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Okay, do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.44,
      "end_seconds": 194.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.78,
      "end_seconds": 200.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.47,
      "end_seconds": 209.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "so, bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.93,
      "end_seconds": 225.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 117 over 71, pulse 79, temp 36.9 degrees, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.53,
      "end_seconds": 230.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.01,
      "end_seconds": 235.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.56,
      "end_seconds": 243.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.65,
      "end_seconds": 246.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.37,
      "end_seconds": 266.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Touching the right cheek sets off the pain and the face muscles work normally."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.41,
      "end_seconds": 303.94,
      "duration_seconds": 32.53,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Okay, so my impression is this: The most likely explanation is trigeminal neuralgia. I can't rule out a dental problem yet. I think an MRI scan of the head makes sense here, for facial pain. I'm prescribing carbamazepine, 100 milligrams, twice a day, titrate. You take it by mouth. It's for nerve pain. Avoid known triggers and eat soft foods when it flares. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.23,
      "end_seconds": 311.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Thank you, uh, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
